Rama praises Hanuman and declares intent toward Vibhishana --- Rama vows never to abandon friend-comer despite faults --- Sugriva endorses Vibhishana purity from signs and conduct --- Rama claims power to kill demons with fingertip --- Rama recalls dove honoring surrendered enemy with flesh --- Rama recites Kandu verse protecting suppliant abandoning life --- Rama vows safety to once saying I am yours --- Rama grants fearlessness and summons Vibhishana through Sugriva --- Rama meets Vibhishana swiftly as Indra meets Garuda
